"""Step 4: B-roll. This is Vidlore's 'Footage Agent'. Provider ladder,
best -> always-works:

  1. PEXELS_API_KEY set    -> real stock video per scene (Pro-ish)
  2. Pollinations AI image -> a unique generated visual per scene,
                              KEYLESS & free (the default). Fixes Vidlore's
                              "content desert / same clips loop" weakness.
  3. themed Ken-Burns slide-> last-resort card if 1 & 2 both fail / disabled

Any per-scene failure silently degrades down the ladder so a run never dies.
"""
